otic game by Waffle.<br>\n<br>\nArahama Yuu has 5 sex-friends. One day, his easygoing sex-life reaches a precipice. One of his partners, Shimizu Misako, who is also a co-worker at his company, had been sleeping with him on the understanding that they would marry. However, he only considered her a sex-friend, and even revealed the existence of the other 4. Incensed, she has him gather the other 4 together in his apartment.<br>\n<br>\nShimizu discovers that Arahama has surrounded himself in the company of many beauties of differing personalities. Besides herself, the others are: Yanagi Ryouko who runs a cafe near Arahama's apartment; Hoshino Kotori, a schoolgirl of his acquaintance; Endou Makiko, who manages a large company; and Kamishima Aina whom he met on an on-line dating site.<br>\n<br>\nShimizu demands that Arahama ceases having casual relations and marries someone. However, the situation get heated and confusing until Arahama somehow ends up proposing to all of them.<br>\n<br>\nIn the days that follow, Arahama visits each of them individually in an effort to withdraw his marriage proposal.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Official Site)","duration":30,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":1,"year":2015},"episodes":4,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://a1c.jp/~collabo/product/tugounoyoisex01.html"}],"genres":["Hentai"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":70,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",92720,78837,"MANGA","NOVEL"]],"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"source":"VISUAL_NOVEL","startDate":{"day":30,"month":11,"year":2012},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":31,"score":10},{"amount":23,"score":20},{"amount":33,"score":30},{"amount":62,"score":40},{"amount":161,"score":50},{"amount":246,"score":60},{"amount":386,"score":70},{"amount":344,"score":80},{"amount":174,"score":90},{"amount":176,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":264,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":1679,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amo